<title>SWEDEN: Stena Line posts slightly lower loss Q1.</title>
<headline>Stena Line posts slightly lower loss Q1.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish ferry operator Stena Line on Thursday posted these figures for the first three months of the year ending on March 31.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss after fin items			493 vs   504</p>
<p> Sales					 1,778 vs 1,592</p>
<p> Net financial items	   CHARGE    105 vs    93 CHARGE</p>
<p>NOTE -- Stena Line does not publish a full first quarter earnings report. These figures were given at its annual general meeting.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
